{
  "id": "17",
  "title": "Realtime Ripple 即時廣播",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.1; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#06B6D4\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M2 12s3-4 10-4 10 4 10 4\"/><path d=\"M2 16s3-4 10-4 10 4 10 4\"/><path d=\"M2 8s3-4 10-4 10 4 10 4\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">**Ripple** 是 Photon 的原生脈動。直接建立在 **Bun WebSocket 核心** 之上，它為公共、私有以及具備狀態感知的即時互動提供了亞秒級別的廣播層。</p></div><h2>即時矩陣 (The Realtime Matrix)</h2><p>Ripple 以零開銷處理 HTTP 生命週期與持久 WebSocket 連線之間的微妙交握，透過受 Laravel Echo 啟發的 API，在分散式節點之間同步狀態。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">BUN_原生支援</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">利用 Bun 高效能的 C++ WebSocket 實作，實現極致的連線密度。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">狀態同步 (Presence)</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">為聊天與協作內建元數據同步。自動追蹤使用者狀態與「正在輸入」等指示器。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20\"/><path d=\"m17 7-5-5-5 5\"/><path d=\"m17 17-5 5-5-5\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">SENTINEL_整合</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">直接與 Sentinel 安全核心整合，實現無縫的頻道授權與 Token 驗證。</p></div></div><h2>安裝指南</h2><p>Ripple 由伺服器端核心模組與通用客戶端 SDK 組成。</p><pre><code># 伺服器端核心\nbun add @gravito/ripple\n\n# 客戶端 SDK (通用)\nbun add @gravito/ripple-client</code></pre><h2>伺服器端同步</h2><p>將 Ripple 模組安裝到您的 PlanetCore 實例中，以啟用 WebSocket 處理功能。</p><pre><code>import { OrbitRipple } from '@gravito/ripple'\n\ncore.install(new OrbitRipple({\n  path: '/ripple',\n  authorizer: async (channel, userId) => {\n    // 授權邏輯\n    if (channel.startsWith('private-')) {\n      return userId !== undefined\n    }\n    return true\n  }\n}))</code></pre><h2>廣播邏輯 (Broadcasting)</h2><p>從控制器、模型或內部服務觸發事件。</p><pre><code>// 1. 流暢介面 (Fluent Broadcaster)\nBroadcaster.to('public.news').emit('Headline', { title: 'Photon v2 已發佈' })\n\n// 2. 封裝的事件類別\nclass MessageSent extends BroadcastEvent {\n  constructor(public message: string) { super() }\n  \n  broadcastOn() {\n    return new PrivateChannel(`chat.${this.roomId}`)\n  }\n}</code></pre><h2>頻道原型 (Archetypes)</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 32px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase;\">公共頻道 (PUBLIC)</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin: 0;\">全開放存取。適合全域系統通知、股價走勢或即時比分。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase;\">私有頻道 (PRIVATE)</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin: 0;\">需要驗證。安全地遞送使用者特定的資料、訂單或安全通知。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"color: #06B6D4; margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase;\">狀態頻道 (PRESENCE)</h4><p style=\"font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.7; margin: 0;\">私有 + 狀態。追蹤誰在線上，非常適合多人遊戲或協作工具。</p></div></div><h2>跨框架客戶端整合</h2><p>Ripple 為所有現代前端技術棧提供了專門構建的封裝。</p><pre><code>// 1. Vanilla JavaScript\nimport { createRippleClient } from '@gravito/ripple-client'\nconst client = createRippleClient('ws://api.photon.dev/ripple')\n\nclient.channel('public.news').listen('Headline', (data) => console.log(data))\n\n// 2. React Hooks\nconst { members, typing } = usePresence('chat.lobby')\n\n// 3. Vue Composables\nconst { channel } = useRipple('orders.123')\nchannel.on('Shipped', (status) => notify(status))</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #06B6D4; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// RIPPLE 規格：核心升級交握 (KERNEL_UPGRADE_HANDOFF)</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Ripple 直接在適配器層處理 HTTP 到 WebSocket 的升級協定。這讓 Photon 能在單個連接埠上同時維持 RESTful API 與即時串流，無需複雜的 Proxy 配置。</p></div><h2>效能指標</h2><p>廣播吞吐量與連線密度分析。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #06B6D4; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>RIPPLE_BUN_原生支援</span> <span>約 80k 併發 (1GB RAM)</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 90%; background: #06B6D4; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>傳統_SOCKET_IO</span> <span>約 4k 併發 (1GB RAM)</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 10%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #06B6D4; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\">**架構師洞察：** 即時互動不僅僅是速度的問題，更是大規模場景下的可靠性。透過將 Ripple 直接嵌入 Photon 核心，我們為中小規模部署消除了由外部訊息代理 (Message Broker) 引起的代理延遲。</p></div>",
